Brethreign — your week
======================

Hi <%= @user.display_name %>,

<% if @user_breaths.positive? %>
You breathed <%= @user_breaths %> time<%= @user_breaths == 1 ? "" : "s" %> this week.<% if @streak.positive? %> You're on a <%= @streak %>-day streak.<% end %>
<% elsif @streak.positive? %>
Your streak is at <%= @streak %> day<%= @streak == 1 ? "" : "s" %>. Open the feed to keep it going.
<% else %>
Quiet week from your side. The community is here when you're ready.
<% end %>

Your week: <%= @user_breaths %> breath<%= @user_breaths == 1 ? "" : "s" %> · <%= @new_followers.size %> new brethren · <%= @chain_joiners %> joined your prayer chains
<% if @new_followers.any? %>
<%= @new_followers.map { |f| f.follower.display_name.presence || f.follower.username }.first(3).to_sentence %> started walking with you this week.
<% end %>
<% if @badges.any? %>
Milestones you earned
---------------------
<% @badges.each do |badge| %><% info = badge.info %>- <%= info[:emoji] %> <%= info[:name] %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
<% if @answered_in_circle.any? %>
Prayers answered this week
--------------------------
<% @answered_in_circle.each do |post| %>
- <%= post.user_id == @user.id ? "Your prayer" : "#{post.user.display_name}'s prayer" %> was answered<% if post.intercessions_count.to_i.positive? %> (<%= post.intercessions_count %> brethren in the chain)<% end %>: <%= Rails.application.routes.url_helpers.post_url(post, host: @host) %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

<% if @top_breaths.any? %>
What your circle has been breathing
-----------------------------------
<% @top_breaths.each do |post| %>
- <%= post.user.display_name %><% if post.room %> · <%= post.room.name %><% end %> · <%= post.published_at.strftime("%b %-d") %>
  <% if post.title.present? %><%= post.title %>
  <% end %><%= truncate(post.content.to_plain_text, length: 180) %>
  Likes <%= post.likes_count %>, comments <%= post.comments_count %>
  <%= Rails.application.routes.url_helpers.post_url(post, host: @host) %>

<% end %>
<% end %>

<% if @open_prayers.any? %>
Prayer chains still in motion
-----------------------------
<% @open_prayers.each do |post| %>
- <%= post.user.display_name %>: <%= truncate(post.content.to_plain_text, length: 140) %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

Open the feed: <%= @feed_url %>

—

Unsubscribe from these digests: <%= @unsubscribe_url %>
